#
# Common ext modules - modules for the external flash (/ext/bin) instead of the firmware
#
# Same format as flash.dmd and sdcard.dmd (a module per line, with the tags driver=, rules=, service= if it needs
# them - driver= goes to build/ext/cfg/drivers, /ext/cfg/drivers on the device, which devscan hands to dmdevfs once /ext
# is mounted; the units and rules are the firmware's, as for every module). Moving a module
# from flash.dmd to here takes it out of the ROM: it is then loaded by name from /ext/bin (on the module search path:
# flash modules first, then /ext/bin, then cards) - once /ext is mounted, so nothing that runs before the "ext"
# service can be here. `upload-ext` sends build/ext to the device.
#
